From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] setup: rename distribution to pysqlite3-binary, bump to
 0.5.4.post2

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [downstream redistribution naming, irrelevant to coleifer/pysqlite3]

pysqlite3-binary is a separate PyPI distribution coleifer publishes from
this same repo: a self-contained, statically-linked build of pysqlite3
under a different project name so users can `pip install
pysqlite3-binary` without a system libsqlite3. There is no git tag for
it -- the `0.5.4.post2` release on PyPI has no matching source changes,
it is the 0.5.4 tag's source rebuilt for newer wheel tags (confirmed by
extracting the released pysqlite3_binary-0.5.4.post2-*.whl: its
pysqlite3/_sqlite3 extension and dbapi2.py are unchanged from this
commit; only packaging metadata differs). Upstream's own
build-scripts/_build_wheels.sh (removed from the repo after 0.6.0) built
this the same way: temporarily swap setup.py's declared `name` to
`pysqlite3-binary` while keeping the `pysqlite3` package/import path
untouched. Reapply that rename here, and set VERSION to match the
released `0.5.4.post2` metadata instead of the tag's bare `0.5.4`.

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 setup.py | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/setup.py b/setup.py
index a4b3c48..b970406 100644
--- a/setup.py
+++ b/setup.py
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ from setuptools import Extension
 # If you need to change anything, it should be enough to change setup.cfg.
 
 PACKAGE_NAME = 'pysqlite3'
-VERSION = '0.5.4'
+VERSION = '0.5.4.post2'
 
 # define sqlite sources
 sources = [os.path.join('src', source)
@@ -125,7 +125,7 @@ class AmalgationLibSqliteBuilder(build_ext):
 
 def get_setup_args():
     return dict(
-        name=PACKAGE_NAME,
+        name='pysqlite3-binary',
         version=VERSION,
         description="DB-API 2.0 interface for Sqlite 3.x",
         long_description='',
--
2.50.1
